":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- *Bugsquad edit: Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120609.*\n\n### Tested versions\n\nN/A\n\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nSo, this isn't really a bug per-say, but, as a native English speaker, the phrase \"Bone Spreader\" conjures up unpleasant imagery. While there is still time, it might be prudent to use a different phrase. Would recommend \"bone stretcher\" or \"bone skin scaler\", but honestly anything else would be great.\n\n\"Spread\" is something one does with butter, or ashes. \"Spreading\" bones is pretty gruesome.\n\nOther than that, the BoneSpreader is fantastic and a super great addition to the engine :)\n\nThat is all!\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nN/A\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122853/reactions","total_count":22,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":14,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"